    {
      "version": "1.1.36",
      "createdAt": 1792286411614,
      "changelog": "story-deslop 1.1.36 adds multi-chapter handling, stricter phase sequencing, long project boundaries, and improves agent compatibility and file safety.\n\n- 明确多章改稿流程，每章单独扫描、派单与报告。\n- 长篇书（含追踪/多章）如剧情有改，推送到 /story-long-write，主流程只管表达与用笔。\n- 「去AI味」「这篇太AI了」等模糊需求按直接改稿，不是只检测；外部检测报告做为具体范围输入。\n- 改稿前自动备份原文，支持撤回；报告里提示备份位置。\n- blocking 查杀更严格：脚本后语义修改才做标点；白名单机制更明晰，报告阻塞原因。\n- Agent 兼容标准升级（agents_version: 36）；spawn 版本检测提示更准确，处理项目与本地版本不匹配。\n- 移除 skill-card.md。",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.34",
      "createdAt": 1792134151938,
      "changelog": "**story-deslop 1.1.34 — 结构升级，三层诊断与去AI味流程重写**\n\n- 拆分去AI味流程为表达、用笔、故事三层检查与改写，替换原有以词句与“Gate”为中心的分级管线。\n- 完善流程边界，对作者偏好、文风继承、授权范围、资料缺失等场景均有明确说明。\n- 全面重写检测和报告样式，突出原文影响、最小改法、授权区分与具体操作步骤。\n- 调整 agent 兼容策略与 agents_version 规则，新版为 35。\n- 移除作者记忆加载与自动记录，作者偏好仅作参考且不自动查询。\n- 新增 references/expression.md、narrative-focus.md、story-logic.md 三份分层参考，精简和重组引用结构与执行入口。",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
    },
    {
      "version": "1.1.27",
      "createdAt": 1791633379358,
      "changelog": "story-deslop 1.1.27\n\n- Added sample changelog for latest skill update.\n- Improved passing of author prose style memory: now only passes the `lines` property (≤2KB) to executor, increasing precision and clarity.\n- Updated documentation in SKILL.md and references to clarify how author memory is handled before rewrites, including usage of `scripts/author_memory_commit.py query`.\n- Removed legacy file `skill-card.md`.\n- Various documentation tweaks and consistency updates for references and inline procedural steps.",
      "changelogSource": "auto"
